SATURDAY 0CT 24 @mrsmallstheatre Sanctuary. We’re celebrating the release of our new LP MIDNIGHT SUMMER with our friends:

@torysilver Pure, honest, Indie Pop bliss. Tory released her gorgeous new album In Through The Front With Lasers produced by Grammy Award Winner (Jay Som), earlier this year.

@morganerina The ambient beauty, power & magic of Morgan’s voice will kick things off to haunt the Sanctuary. She’s featured on “Darling’s In The Night,” & “Book Of Love,” from our new album.

@andre_costello will join Animal Scream on guitar for a few songs. His latest release Rocky Mountain Low captures Andre’s freewheeling breezy spirit alongside chunky buzzing guitars.

IT’S A MASQUERADE DANCE PARTY! Costumes Encouraged 💋

SOUL/DISCO/80’S Jamz Provided by: DJ @itsjennabrooke Spinning Vinyl Records

COME DANCE YOURSELF CLEAN!
Poster Art & Design: @_em.wood

